{"bookId": "3300142877", "title": "我看见的世界：李飞飞自传", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1764601614, "updated": [{"bookId": "3300142877", "chapterIdx": 8, "bookmarkId": "3300142877_8_3387-3500", "range": "3387-3500", "markText": "对光的感知迅速发展，其核心在于一类被称为“视蛋白”的蛋白质。这种蛋白质具有独特的性质，比如在吸收光子时会改变形状（本质上是对光的物理反应），并连接成一种叫作“离子通道”的链条，将这种反应转化为生物电信号，传输到身体的其他部位。", "colorStyle": 4, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "createTime": 1764601614}, {"bookId": "3300142877", "chapterIdx": 4, "bookmarkId": "3300142877_4_6699-6861", "range": "6699-6861", "markText": "我今天要阐明的观点只有一个，我在脑海中反复默念，像在重复自己的信条：“在科学和工业领域，推动人工智能发展的动机是什么，这个问题非常重要。我认为这个动机必须明确地以人为本。”我试着不去想任何其他事情——人工智能的阴暗面、科技抵制浪潮等等，甚至有那么几分钟，连母亲的病情也被我抛到脑后。我的脑子里只有一个信条：发展的动机最重要。", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 4, "createTime": 1764201205}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "05 第一道光", "chapterUid": 8, "chapterIdx": 8}, {"title": "01 如坐针毡的华盛顿之行", "chapterUid": 4, "chapterIdx": 4}], "book": {"bookId": "3300142877", "version": 1292066813, "format": "epub", "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/28/cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m1/s_cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m11745725507.jpg", "title": "我看见的世界：李飞飞自传", "author": "[美]李飞飞", "coverBoxInfo": {"blurhash": "K6AAE?of9F80flRiI9ayjY", "colors": [{"key": "1/4", "hex": "#001e35"}, {"key": "1/6", "hex": "#001f40"}, {"key": "1/8", "hex": "#00204c"}, {"key": "2/4", "hex": "#15334a"}, {"key": "2/6", "hex": "#003457"}, {"key": "2/8", "hex": "#003564"}, {"key": "3/4", "hex": "#2b4b63"}, {"key": "3/6", "hex": "#0b4c70"}, {"key": "3/8", "hex": "#004d7d"}, {"key": "3/12", "hex": "#004f97"}, {"key": "4/6", "hex": "#336587"}, {"key": "4/10", "hex": "#0067a2"}, {"key": "4/4", "hex": "#46637a"}, {"key": "5/10", "hex": "#0081bc"}, {"key": "5/4", "hex": "#607d93"}, {"key": "5/8", "hex": "#3580ae"}, {"key": "6/4", "hex": "#7b97ac"}, {"key": "6/6", "hex": "#6999ba"}, {"key": "6/8", "hex": "#539ac8"}, {"key": "6/12", "hex": "#009de6"}, {"key": "7/8", "hex": "#6eb5e3"}, {"key": "7/10", "hex": "#4db7f4"}, {"key": "7/12", "hex": "#00b9ff"}, {"key": "8/4", "hex": "#adcce2"}, {"key": "8/6", "hex": "#9acef1"}, {"key": "8/12", "hex": "#00d5ff"}, {"key": "9/2", "hex": "#d8e5ed"}, {"key": "9/12", "hex": "#3cf2ff"}, {"key": "1/100", "hex": "#539ac8"}, {"key": "2/100", "hex": "#6eb5e3"}, {"key": "3/100", "hex": "#ffffff"}, {"key": "4/100", "hex": "#E5ECF3"}, {"key": "5/100", "hex": "#E5ECF3"}, {"key": "6/100", "hex": "#001927"}], "dominate_color": {"hex": "#062b43", "hsv": [204.06498355689203, 90.26568864429036, 26.167220080126462]}, "custom_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookalphacover/877/3300142877/s_3300142877.jpg", "custom_rec_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookreccover/877/3300142877/s_3300142877.jpg", "colorsPure": ["#009de6", "#00b9ff"]}}}, "reviews": {"reviews": [{"reviewId": "17408780_857iySQpR", "review": {"bookId": "3300142877", "content": "贝叶斯！", "bookVersion": 1292066813, "range": "16190-16278", "abstract": "在我的演讲结束后，大家展开了热烈的讨论。我突然意识到一件微妙的事情——我被问到的每个问题都与算法本身有关：你是如何建立贝叶斯方程来估计后验概率的？你是如何估计图像的先验分布的？", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 9, "chapterName": "06 北极星", "chapterIdx": 9, "reviewId": "17408780_857iySQpR", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1764743525, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300142877", "format": "epub", "version": 1292066813, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/28/cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m1/s_cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m11745725507.jpg", "title": "我看见的世界：李飞飞自传", "author": "[美]李飞飞", "translator": "赵灿", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 北极星", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_857h3YEBn", "review": {"bookId": "3300142877", "content": "“所见即所知”，确实如此，无论什么科学实验，最后都要转换成图像才能证实。即使是广义相对论，也要等到大家真的看到那个光圈才能相信。", "bookVersion": 1292066813, "range": "15031-15065", "abstract": "很多时候，“所见即所知”，因此，了解我们如何看见，就是了解我们自己。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "chapterName": "05 第一道光", "chapterIdx": 8, "reviewId": "17408780_857h3YEBn", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1764742152, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300142877", "format": "epub", "version": 1292066813, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/28/cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m1/s_cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m11745725507.jpg", "title": "我看见的世界：李飞飞自传", "author": "[美]李飞飞", "translator": "赵灿", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "05 第一道光", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_857gTwJqL", "review": {"bookId": "3300142877", "content": "再问，为什么不是听觉，嗅觉，单单是听觉即智力？是宇宙冥冥之中决定了光子的重要性，宇宙大爆炸辐射出来的光子决定了我们人类的智力。对比光子，而空气振动现象不值一提？", "bookVersion": 1292066813, "range": "14568-14600", "abstract": "所以，视觉不仅仅是我们对智力的应用，实际上，它就是智力的同义词。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "chapterName": "05 第一道光", "chapterIdx": 8, "reviewId": "17408780_857gTwJqL", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1764741998, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300142877", "format": "epub", "version": 1292066813, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/28/cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m1/s_cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m11745725507.jpg", "title": "我看见的世界：李飞飞自传", "author": "[美]李飞飞", "translator": "赵灿", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "05 第一道光", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 2}, {"reviewId": "17408780_854NQYjSi", "review": {"bookId": "3300142877", "content": "为什么不是声音呢？", "bookVersion": 1292066813, "range": "4121-4267", "abstract": "仅仅通过让光线进入体内（无论光线多么昏暗、多么模糊不清），远古生物就第一次认识到，在它们自身之外还存在着某种事物。更紧迫的是，它们意识到自己需要努力求生，而面对的结果不止一种。它们开始感觉到，周围的环境无比严酷，威胁与机会并存，对资源的竞争日益激烈，而它们的行为决定了自己是捕食者还是被食者。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "chapterName": "05 第一道光", "chapterIdx": 8, "reviewId": "17408780_854NQYjSi", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1764601792, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300142877", "format": "epub", "version": 1292066813, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/28/cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m1/s_cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m11745725507.jpg", "title": "我看见的世界：李飞飞自传", "author": "[美]李飞飞", "translator": "赵灿", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "05 第一道光", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_854oOjcXg", "review": {"bookId": "3300142877", "content": "大学期间没有爱情的填补吗？", "bookVersion": 1292066813, "range": "25897-25937", "abstract": "在经历了几乎从来没有过真正归属感的青春期之后，我突然确信我找到了属于自己的位置。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "chapterName": "04 心智探索", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "17408780_854oOjcXg", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1764578849, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300142877", "format": "epub", "version": 1292066813, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/28/cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m1/s_cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m11745725507.jpg", "title": "我看见的世界：李飞飞自传", "author": "[美]李飞飞", "translator": "赵灿", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 心智探索", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_854dLkiKZ", "review": {"bookId": "3300142877", "content": "还有一个说法叫《涌现》", "bookVersion": 1292066813, "range": "23045-23086", "abstract": "当神经元以千亿计的数量级复制，当它们之间的连接达到10的11次方时，质变就发生了。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "chapterName": "04 心智探索", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "17408780_854dLkiKZ", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1764568728, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300142877", "format": "epub", "version": 1292066813, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/28/cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m1/s_cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m11745725507.jpg", "title": "我看见的世界：李飞飞自传", "author": "[美]李飞飞", "translator": "赵灿", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 心智探索", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_854d1KT7S", "review": {"bookId": "3300142877", "content": "确实是", "bookVersion": 1292066813, "range": "15655-15669", "abstract": "普林斯顿大学的学生都很有钱，", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "chapterName": "04 心智探索", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "17408780_854d1KT7S", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1764568054, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300142877", "format": "epub", "version": 1292066813, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/28/cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m1/s_cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m11745725507.jpg", "title": "我看见的世界：李飞飞自传", "author": "[美]李飞飞", "translator": "赵灿", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "04 心智探索", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_854aQ4n8T", "review": {"bookId": "3300142877", "content": "现在常青藤的申请难度已经提高了几个量级，卷到天边了。", "bookVersion": 1292066813, "range": "29442-29838", "abstract": "12月一个异常寒冷的下午，我收到了学校的回复——学费似乎并不是我的入学障碍。那天放学后，我去取信，脏脏的积雪几乎把邮筒全部掩埋。我拨开雪，打开邮箱。突然，我停住了，深深地吸了一口气。我看向邮筒里面，立刻认出了最上面那个信封上的徽章。一个橙黑相间的盾牌——普林斯顿大学。我已经大概知道结果了：如果是大学的录取通知书，包裹会非常厚实，因为里面会装满新生的入学材料和后续说明。很明显，信箱里的信并不属于这种情况。\n虽然我不用打开信封就知道录取决定是什么，但我还是决定读一下，好彻底死心。我毫不在意地撕开信封，然而第一个映入眼帘的词竟是“YES ！”，这个词自成一行，还加粗了。我赶紧往下多读了几段，才明白了信的大意。看来，我的申请是进入了提前录取周期，在此期间，所有回复都是用薄信封寄出的。如果我没看错的话——当时我还不敢肯定——我被录取了。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "03 鸿沟渐窄", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "17408780_854aQ4n8T", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1764566049, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300142877", "format": "epub", "version": 1292066813, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/28/cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m1/s_cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m11745725507.jpg", "title": "我看见的世界：李飞飞自传", "author": "[美]李飞飞", "translator": "赵灿", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "03 鸿沟渐窄", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_853TUILdp", "review": {"bookId": "3300142877", "content": "机器尚且如此，达利奥还在写什么“原则”，可笑。", "bookVersion": 1292066813, "range": "10660-10747", "abstract": "此前的几代人试图用规则详尽描述智能，算法相对僵化，这种人工智能通常被称为“符号人工智能”(symbolic AI)；20世纪80年代末到90年代初，潮流开始转向更自然的方法。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "03 鸿沟渐窄", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "17408780_853TUILdp", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime"