0", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_84XKFw0u3", "review": {"bookId": "3300142877", "content": "很好奇是什么让李飞飞如此坚信人工智能是人类对的发展方向？如果以人为本，什么是对，什么是错呢？", "bookVersion": 1292066813, "range": "6699-6861", "abstract": "我今天要阐明的观点只有一个，我在脑海中反复默念，像在重复自己的信条：“在科学和工业领域，推动人工智能发展的动机是什么，这个问题非常重要。我认为这个动机必须明确地以人为本。”我试着不去想任何其他事情——人工智能的阴暗面、科技抵制浪潮等等，甚至有那么几分钟，连母亲的病情也被我抛到脑后。我的脑子里只有一个信条：发展的动机最重要。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 4, "chapterName": "01 如坐针毡的华盛顿之行", "chapterIdx": 4, "reviewId": "17408780_84XKFw0u3", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1764201273, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300142877", "format": "epub", "version": 1292066813, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/28/cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m1/s_cpplatform_kg3xhzvscqeh1fgafdx7m11745725507.jpg", "title": "我看见的世界：李飞飞自传", "author": "[美]李飞飞", "translator": "赵灿", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "01 如坐针毡的华盛顿之行", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}], "totalCount": 14}}